{"text": "I began to fear his wits were touched.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "wits", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "fear", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:1260_jane_eyre_an_autobiography", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "These stalwart virgins had no men to fear and therefore no need of protection.", "args": [{"head": "virgins", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "men", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "fear", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:32_herland", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I fear the kitten has rolled it away.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "kitten", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "fear", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:145_middlemarch", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She suffered from pique, and sometimes in a curious fashion she desired Philip.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "philip", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "desire", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:351_of_human_bondage", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He craved the madness of alcohol in his veins till his delicate hands trembled.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "madness", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "crave", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:15265_the_quest_of_the_silver_fleece_a_novel", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "This was what her heart craved.", "args": [{"head": "heart", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "what", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "crave", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:233_sister_carrie_a_novel", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "Why did you go away, when I loved you so?", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "you", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "love", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:110_tess_of_the_durbervilles_a_pure_woman", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "No one could see Catherine Linton and not love her.", "args": [{"head": "one", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "her", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "love", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:768_wuthering_heights", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I hate and detest you!", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "you", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "hate", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:110_tess_of_the_durbervilles_a_pure_woman", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Old boy hated her.", "args": [{"head": "boy", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "her", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "hate", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:1155_the_secret_adversary", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She had never hoped that that barrier would be surmounted.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "barrier", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "hope", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:2005_piccadilly_jim", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I hope Laddy's not mistaken in his opinion of this newcomer.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "laddy", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "hope", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:502_desert_gold", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He dreaded the interview with Thomas Jordan.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "interview", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "dread", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:217_sons_and_lovers", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "The terrible moment, the moment she had dreaded, had come at last.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "moment", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "dread", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:174_the_picture_of_dorian_gray", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "But she dreads responsibility.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "responsibility", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "dread", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:432_the_ambassadors", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "She longed for the quiet of the old garden.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "quiet", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "long", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He longed to be gone from that hateful place.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "long", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "infinitival_complement", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I dare say Miss Nash would wish you such an opportunity.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "opportunity", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "wish", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The unpaid secretary admired this pluck.", "args": [{"head": "secretary", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "pluck", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "admire", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:974_the_secret_agent_a_simple_tale", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "They don't admire you half so much as you admire yourselves.", "args": [{"head": "they", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "you", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "admire", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:145_middlemarch", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I am very fond of Amelia; I adore her.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "her", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "adore", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:599_vanity_fair", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He adored Sorais quite as earnestly as Sir Henry adored Nyleptha.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "sorais", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "adore", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:711_allan_quatermain", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I dare say Miss Nash would envy you such an opportunity as this of being married.", "args": [{"head": "nash", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "you", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "opportunity", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "envy", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "ditransitive", "source": "litbank:158_emma", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Helen, watching Bo play, was inclined to envy her.", "args": [{"head": "helen", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "her", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "envy", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:3457_the_man_of_the_forest", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I pity Pa to that degree.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "pa", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "pity", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:1023_bleak_house", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The impulse that I had upon me was to pity her so much.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "her", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "pity", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:1023_bleak_house", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Dorian Gray loathed him more than ever.", "args": [{"head": "gray", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "him", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "loathe", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:174_the_picture_of_dorian_gray", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "He loathed a fork.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "fork", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "loathe", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:217_sons_and_lovers", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "I loathe that man.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "man", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "loathe", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:434_the_circular_staircase", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "She still cherished a very tender affection for Bingley.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "affection", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "cherish", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:1342_pride_and_prejudice", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "Wickham still cherished the hope of making his fortune by marriage.", "args": [{"head": "wickham", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "hope", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "cherish", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:1342_pride_and_prejudice", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "Emma listened with the warmest concern, grieved for her more and more.", "args": [{"head": "emma", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "her", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "grieve", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "litbank:158_emma", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He mourned her disappointment.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "disappointment", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "mourn", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Rawdon marvelled over his stories about school, and fights, and fagging.", "args": [{"head": "rawdon", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "stories", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "marvel", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "litbank:599_vanity_fair", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Dick marveled that her collapse had not come sooner.", "args": [{"head": "dick", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "collapse", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "marvel", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:502_desert_gold", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I wonder whether he will come at all.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "he", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "wonder", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I rejoiced, for I knew that what she could not, none of those we dreaded could.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "rejoice", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "intransitive", "source": "litbank:345_dracula", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She quailed as she thought of the amount and rejoiced because the rent was paid.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "rejoice", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "intransitive", "source": "litbank:233_sister_carrie_a_novel", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Now you begin to fret about your feeling and about my feeling.", "args": [{"head": "you", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "feeling", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "fret", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "litbank:1245_night_and_day", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Miss Linton fretted and pined over something.", "args": [{"head": "linton", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "something", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "fret", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "litbank:768_wuthering_heights", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Catherine had an awfully perverted taste to esteem him so dearly.", "args": [{"head": "catherine", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "him", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "esteem", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:768_wuthering_heights", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She despised him, and was tied to him.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "him", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "despise", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:217_sons_and_lovers", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Belding was sure Nell cordially despised the fellow.", "args": [{"head": "nell", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "fellow", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "despise", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:502_desert_gold", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I did not relish the notion of fastening myself in with Heathcliff.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "notion", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "relish", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:768_wuthering_heights", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Mr Power did not relish the use of his Christian name.", "args": [{"head": "power", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "use", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "relish", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:2814_dubliners", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "For a few minutes Anne enjoyed the romance of her situation to the full.", "args": [{"head": "anne", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "romance", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "enjoy", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:45_anne_of_green_gables", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He enjoys it like a boy.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "it", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "enjoy", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:514_little_women", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She valued his good opinion above all things.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "opinion", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "value", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Mr Duffy abhorred anything which betokened physical or mental disorder.", "args": [{"head": "duffy", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "anything", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "abhor", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:2814_dubliners", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I abhorred the face of man.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "face", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "abhor", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:84_frankenstein_or_the_modern_prometheus", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He resented Hayward's contempt for action and success.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "contempt", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "resent", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:351_of_human_bondage", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "But he resented those words bitterly.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "words", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "resent", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:4276_north_and_south", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I coveted a cake of bread.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "cake", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "covet", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:1260_jane_eyre_an_autobiography", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "It is impossible that you can covet the admiration of Heathcliff.", "args": [{"head": "you", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "admiration", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "covet", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:768_wuthering_heights", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She regretted what they had been, so small and exquisite.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "what", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "regret", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:217_sons_and_lovers", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I regret that I am not a man.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "man", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "regret", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:78_tarzan_of_the_apes", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "That poor boy will miss you something cruel.", "args": [{"head": "boy", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "you", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "miss", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:974_the_secret_agent_a_simple_tale", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I rather miss my wild girl.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "girl", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "miss", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:514_little_women", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I doubt whether my own sense would have corrected me without it.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "sense", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "doubt", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:158_emma", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He doubted not at all that she would use it.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "she", "role": "THEME"}], "verb_lemma": "doubt", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "clausal_complement", "source": "litbank:502_desert_gold", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She trusted him with her whole heart.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "him", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "trust", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He believed that women revere men for their manliness.", "args": [{"head": "women", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "men", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "revere", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "transitive", "source": "litbank:2641_a_room_with_a_view", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I'm pining to see you dance.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "pine", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "infinitival_complement", "source": "litbank:217_sons_and_lovers", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She yearned for a word of kindness from him.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "word", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "yearn", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "He yearned after the friends of his boyhood.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "friends", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "yearn", "exp_type": "subj", "construction": "pp_complement", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "It frightened me very much, but I shot it in the ear.", "args": [{"head": "it", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "me", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "frighten", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:711_allan_quatermain", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Jo was frightened.", "args": [{"head": "jo", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "frighten", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:514_little_women", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The novel disaster had frightened stouter-hearted Jacks on bigger beanstalks.", "args": [{"head": "disaster", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "jacks", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "frighten", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:514_little_women", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The reader will be pleased, I believe, to return with me to Sophia.", "args": [{"head": "reader", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "please", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:6593_history_of_tom_jones_a_foundling", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "His mother was glad, he seemed so pleased.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "please", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:217_sons_and_lovers", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The loud reproach angered him beyond all measure.", "args": [{"head": "reproach", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "him", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "anger", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The very gentleness which had first delighted her turned to an affectation.", "args": [{"head": "gentleness", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "her", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "delight", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:1342_pride_and_prejudice", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "I'm delighted to see you!", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "delight", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:2005_piccadilly_jim", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He was amused and interested by her conversation.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "conversation", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "amuse", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:351_of_human_bondage", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Richard, quite amused with me, said he would be all right.", "args": [{"head": "richard", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "me", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "amuse", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:1023_bleak_house", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "What astonished him was the endurance of Nell's mother.", "args": [{"head": "what", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "him", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "astonish", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:502_desert_gold", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "I stared, astonished, and stirred profoundly by the man's resolution.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "resolution", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "astonish", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:36_the_war_of_the_worlds", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
