{"text": "If the flood annoyed him, so much the better.", "args": [{"head": "flood", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "him", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "annoy", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:1260_jane_eyre_an_autobiography", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "That seemed to annoy the stranger very much.", "args": [{"head": "that", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "stranger", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "annoy", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:5230_the_invisible_man_a_grotesque_romance", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "The sudden roar terrified the horses.", "args": [{"head": "roar", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "horses", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "terrify", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "She was terrified by the shadow on the wall.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "shadow", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "terrify", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "heldout"}
{"text": "He no longer alarmed her at all; she regarded him as a kind thing.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "her", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "alarm", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:2641_a_room_with_a_view", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "But I will not alarm you unnecessarily.", "args": [{"head": "i", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "you", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "alarm", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:3268_the_mysteries_of_udolpho", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "Jimmy was surprised, relieved, and pleased.", "args": [{"head": "jimmy", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "surprise", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:2005_piccadilly_jim", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "He was disgusted at its sentimentality.", "args": [{"head": "he", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "sentimentality", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "disgust", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "litbank:351_of_human_bondage", "split_recommendation": "train"}
