{"text": "An illness she did not know might explain what had so much puzzled her.", "args": [{"head": "what", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "her", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "puzzle", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:351_of_human_bondage", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She had the misfortune of answering questions which puzzled her sister.", "args": [{"head": "questions", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "sister", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "puzzle", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "litbank:158_emma", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "It distressed her deeply to see him so changed.", "args": [{"head": "it", "role": "STIMULUS"}, {"head": "her", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}], "verb_lemma": "distress", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_active", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
{"text": "She was distressed beyond measure by the news.", "args": [{"head": "she", "role": "EXPERIENCER"}, {"head": "news", "role": "STIMULUS"}], "verb_lemma": "distress", "exp_type": "obj", "construction": "exp_obj_passive", "source": "supplement", "split_recommendation": "train"}
